        <p class="pp-footer-desc">
          Everything you need to grow, nurture and maintain beautiful green spaces. Engineered for modern growers and commercial nurseries.
        </p>
        <div class="pp-footer-socials">
          <a href="#" class="pp-social-btn" aria-label="Instagram">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect width="20" height="20" x="2" y="2" rx="5" ry="5"/><path d="M16 11.37A4 4 0 1 1 12.63 8 4 4 0 0 1 16 11.37z"/><line x1="17.5" x2="17.51" y1="6.5" y2="6.5"/></svg>
